1
00:00:00,176 --> 00:00:05,446
(Sheldon:)That being said, if you don't get a TARDIS,
you stink and your party stinks.

2
00:00:06,282 --> 00:00:09,042
- Do you have a preference?
- I don't care, get the TARDIS.

3
00:00:09,251 --> 00:00:13,191
(Sheldon:)Yes! This party just became a major rager.

4
00:00:14,423 --> 00:00:17,013
(Raj:)By the way, can I borrow
your bullwhip and fedora?

5
00:00:17,459 --> 00:00:19,219
(Howard:)Yeah, sure, whatever.

6
00:00:19,428 --> 00:00:23,798
(Raj:)I was thinking of dressing up as
Indiana Jones's mocha-skinned love child.

7
00:00:26,368 --> 00:00:28,398
(Raj:)Indian Jones.

8
00:00:30,773 --> 00:00:33,673
- Clever.
- What's wrong with you?

9
00:00:33,976 --> 00:00:35,276
(Leonard:)Nothing.

10
00:00:35,477 --> 00:00:39,967
(Raj:)Howard, I've got a party to plan,
don't make me pull it out of you.

11
00:00:40,783 --> 00:00:47,743
(Howard:)Here it is. Bernadette said you guys are
sick of me talking about my trip to space.

12
00:00:47,957 --> 00:00:49,087
(Howard:)Is that true?

13
00:00:49,592 --> 00:00:51,822
(Howard:)- No.
- Yes.

14
00:00:53,229 --> 00:00:55,259
(Sheldon:)We seem to have different approaches here.

15
00:00:55,464 --> 00:01:02,024
(Sheldon:)I was going for helpful honesty,
I have no idea what you're doing.

